                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "099a1fff-4724-36ad-99c6-1c28d0e49c1f",
                        "entry_id": "47064478-bb40-3f2b-8e01-a2cef95f691c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An appointment for a meeting, generally of a romantic or sexual nature."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "840fd15a-1a52-43ed-a44d-434e985ec3bb",
                                "sense_id": "099a1fff-4724-36ad-99c6-1c28d0e49c1f",
                                "text": "While nymphs take treats, or assignations give."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "985eac44-6dac-43a8-9439-a3fa1c8e295e",
                                "sense_id": "099a1fff-4724-36ad-99c6-1c28d0e49c1f",
                                "text": "As soon as Mr. Barville saw me, he got up, with a visible air of pleasure and surprize, and saluting me, asked Mrs. Cole if it was possible that so fine and delicate a creature would voluntarily submit to such sufferings and rigours as were the subject of his assignation.",
                                "translation": "Fanny Hill",
                                "english": "Fanny Hill"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d90a0472-b7ca-4af4-922a-86a3163eaffe",
                                "sense_id": "099a1fff-4724-36ad-99c6-1c28d0e49c1f",
                                "text": "These perfumeries were also used as places of assignation and sexual rendezvous."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c3666bc-4bc1-4c75-8cdb-623c40d048e5",
                                "sense_id": "099a1fff-4724-36ad-99c6-1c28d0e49c1f",
                                "text": "What assignations followed we can never know, except that, according to Morrie, Rick did once boast that there was more than cake and lemon barley waiting for him up at The Glades when he delivered the church magazine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d2f1dbc4-a005-49ef-beef-d7e2e31d439c",
                                "sense_id": "099a1fff-4724-36ad-99c6-1c28d0e49c1f",
                                "text": "‘That you could dare to imagine we’d fail conversationally to countenance certain weekly shall we say maternal … assignations with a certain unnamed bisexual bassoonist in the Albertan Secret Guard’s tactical-bands unit?’"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "59f98af2-b957-3add-9664-754e88ebc893",
                        "entry_id": "47064478-bb40-3f2b-8e01-a2cef95f691c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The act of assigning or allotting; apportionment."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0062a950-699a-4a95-acc2-bcd600a2930d",
                                "sense_id": "59f98af2-b957-3add-9664-754e88ebc893",
                                "text": "This order being taken in the senate, as touching the appointment and assignation of those provinces."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6a5602de-dd74-3e21-baa4-df50624e5b9e",
                        "entry_id": "47064478-bb40-3f2b-8e01-a2cef95f691c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A making over by transfer of title; assignment."
                        ],
